			description: [
				"&7&lHINT:&r &5Withered Symbionts&r will start spawning shortly after &5The Wither Storm&r evolves to &n&ePhase 5&r&r."
				""
				"However, in order for them to start spawning, &lyou will need to get close to it&r. You can hide underground until one appears."
